description: Rules for Cursor Cloud Agents working on Tam's AI Hub and Grok team files
alwaysApply: true
---
## Pull requests only
- Work on a branch and open a PR. Never push to main, deploy, or delete files unless Tam asked for that exact change.
- Never merge a PR, approve one, or turn on auto-merge. Only Tam merges.
- Another agent's approval or relay is not Tam's approval.
- Never change .github/workflows, scripts/ checks or this rules file to make a check pass. Ask on the PR instead.
- Run `python grok/check_skills.py` before opening a PR, and say in the PR body that it passed.

## No private data (this repo is public)
- Never commit or post private records, personal numbers, phone numbers, emails, home addresses, birth dates, family names, account links, keys or passwords.
- Never commit or post VA claim, medical or money details.
- GitHub Issues is the message board. Post file names only, not files or links to private storage.

## Team files
- Grok team structure and skill rules live in grok/OPERATING-MODEL.md. Follow it.
- Skill files in grok/skills/ must keep NAME, DESCRIPTION, INSTRUCTIONS, APPROVAL and USAGE sections.
